{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"查询应用包的解析状态，用于创建包含游戏礼包码的营销计划。在提交解析应用包任务后，可通过此接口查询状态，当包解析状态为“SUCCESS”时可提交创建营销计划，否则可能导致游戏礼包码的原生转化卡信息展示不全。关键配合接口为【提交解析应用包任务】。\",\"id\":\"ad.tools_package.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/download/package/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"1696710744774656\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.tools_package.submit_parse\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710744089612\",\"reason\":\"需要先提交解析应用包任务，获取事件ID，才能查询包解析状态\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"提交解析应用包任务\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"1696710744774656\",\"title\":\"查询包解析状态\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uiEc8DPl\">查询包解析状态，用于创建包含游戏礼包码的营销计划时，<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710744089612\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【提交解析应用包任务】</a>后，查询应用包的解析状态。 当返回参数<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">package_status</span></code>包解析状态为<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">“<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">SUCCESS</span>”</code>时表示包解析已经完成。此时，您可以提交创建营销计划。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-uAvL5Ig6\">如果在没有解析完成时提交营销计划可能导致游戏礼包码的原生转化卡信息展示不全。</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201772633771666445%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-U9zxQH0m\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-8Qo2x1yu\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/download/package/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/download/package/get/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710744774656\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-BuDBlJc6\" id=\"link-1\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-6a3W0Rs8\">GET</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-R13zCyKN\" id=\"link-2\">Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t1e39d7f-heCMyi0U\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-DIUgq67E\"><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-bZOZJKjf\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-rD2zkoPz\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-3jPor5HB\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-LKUT5W65\"><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-ORjE96DI\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-qsXGVNnQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SkfEunR9\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t54b56e0-4lJ0Alfk\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nBpBEuvh\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tfafd194-hhzE5mR6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align